{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>To utter with the lips.</b> Speech of the lips." "<b>To harm.</b> To one whom he is obligated, or according to the Gaon [Saadia], to fast. The sense of mentioning Elah is that he is obligated to confess, and regarding the others, which are negative commandments, he does not confess before the priest, and the offering is one."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:38.972049853Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}